        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The chart below shows the numbers of three types of visitors to a museum between 1997 and 2012. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W5XJd06MOoqUJTxQJy1lt3cggsf\"><em><strong>The chart below shows the numbers of three types of visitors to a museum between 1997 and 2012. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Museum Visitors by Type: 1997&ndash;2012</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PpAQdbcgBoyaJuxOGwLl8RlggYg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Museum Visitors by Type: 1997&ndash;2012 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về số lượng ba loại kh&aacute;ch tham quan kh&aacute;c nhau đến một bảo t&agrave;ng trong giai đoạn từ 1997 đến 2012</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZFsmd1V9iofCYxxOcRelyCFJgOh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</span></a></strong> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UwUUdf5sZokLn7xZcxklxQHbgSe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Museum Visitors by Type: 1997&ndash;2012 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: số lượng ba loại kh&aacute;ch tham quan - một bảo t&agrave;ng - giai đoạn 15 năm từ 1997 đến 2012</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HBJLdorasotac9xk723lTjoAg9g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WX6Hd7eA8odriFxhJAKlIfzzgKd\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZIqCdEJ5soiGe7x1fZIlmMHxgad\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: trong khi </strong>adult visitors c&oacute; <strong>sự tăng mạnh</strong> v&agrave; special exhibition visitors c&oacute; <strong>sự tăng nhẹ</strong>, th&igrave; visitors aged under 15 <strong>giảm mạnh</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DBlndbGOzoVBCIxwUEtlYuhdg7c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>adult visitors lu&ocirc;n l&agrave; nh&oacute;m tham quan lớn nhất, <strong>trong khi</strong> special exhibition visitors l&agrave; nh&oacute;m &iacute;t nhất</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;n</strong><strong>g</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MR2odK7csoqQDGxgbqQl7nEEgBr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Adult visitors</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PIRGd2Ulfo4ZmNxU719lbZkngrb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GLnAduiRZowYihxufAklnwjugXg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>Mi&ecirc;u tả số liệu năm 1997 </strong><em>(đứng ở mức 300,000 người)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MIcZdxIHwotDqtxPUc9lDY9sgCt\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của adult visitor </strong><em>(c&oacute; sự tăng th&ecirc;m 2000 v&agrave;o năm 2012 v&agrave; </em><em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em><em> để </em><em><strong>đạt đỉnh</strong></em><em> ở mức 400,000 năm 2007. Sau đ&oacute;, giảm xuống 380,000 năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvfvdfv9Vo7yfXxN0vSlBYakgjf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Visitors aged under 15 v&agrave; Special exhibition visitors</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WjjtdQlWCohcK0xhEDtlB0bfglb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZOHXdUT7Jocm8Uxn9GvlgGkQgFe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>Mi&ecirc;u tả số liệu năm 1997 </strong><em>(visitors aged under 15 ở mức 120,000 người, special exhibition visitors đạt 28,000 người)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Va6qdRjGwomTxixkFFTlrIrKgGg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của visitors aged under 15 </strong><em>(giảm dần đạt 82,300 người v&agrave;o năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Eh9RdUlXnobS6dxfmgDljsT2gOc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của special exhibition visitors </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>c&oacute; xu hướng tăng</strong></em><em> đạt 42,000 người v&agrave;o năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasin</strong><strong>g</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6Q5dNsjTogsZxxKU2qlf4WmgLb\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2MCdvXR5oooHCxOvw2lEnlngwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YYwxdNB3wo0hjlxvlWhlXI3ogTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IvHvdUAOfoV1yXxRU2llgqvYgAb\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt&nbsp;<strong>\"đi tham quan bảo t&agrave;ng nhiều nhất\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"visited the museum the most\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"dominated museum attendance\"</strong> để c&acirc;u vắn đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V</strong><strong>&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">In addition, adult visitors consistently <strong>dominated museum attendance.</strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 447,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HIp3dCMoUoxamlx4PVqlUxGRgcg\">The bar chart illustrates the number of three different visitor groups to a museum over a 15-year period from 1997 to 2012.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13799,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 448,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GtzgdGvULoarr4xthmDlChTxgSc\">Overall, while adult visitors showed a substantial increase and special exhibition visitors experienced a slight growth during the period shown, the number of visitors aged under 15 declined significantly. In addition, adult visitors consistently dominated museum attendance, whereas special exhibition visitors remained the smallest group throughout the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13799,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 449,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q8ORdnXpmooUGcxPncpl46jlgze\">Looking at adult visitors, who visited the museum the most, their figure stood at approximately 300,000 in 1997, and after a slight increase of about 2,000 by 2002, it rose significantly to reach its peak of around 400,000 in 2007. However, the number fell slightly to 380,000 by the end of the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13799,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 450,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CHRedL1j5ond4jxRBCMl9Kjegwg\">Regarding the other two categories, visitors aged under 15 started at 120,000 in 1997, before declining steadily to 82,300 in 2012. In contrast, the number of special exhibition visitors showed an upward trend, with their numbers increasing from 28,000 to 42,000 over the 15-year period.</div>\n</div>",
